{"id": "08ff5cc0-5670-4557-a552-398a575bbf98", "title": "Multi-Tier Supply Chain Visibility", "text": "CPG companies need visibility beyond Tier-1 suppliers. Key metrics: Tier-1 supplier risk score, Tier-2 concentration risk (>30% from single source = high risk). For a CPG portfolio of 50+ SKUs, recommended technology stack: supply chain control tower (SAP IBP, o9 Solutions, or Kinaxis), AI demand sensing layer (with event ingestion from geopolitical risk feeds), carrier performance monitoring (Flexport, project44), n-tier supplier mapping (Resilinc, riskmethods). Critical KPIs: Perfect Order Rate >95%, OTIF >92%, Forecast Accuracy >85% (WMAPE), Cash-to-Cash Cycle <45 days. [Source: CPG Industry Intelligence Report Q3 2024, Confidence: 0.93]", "metadata": {"type": "intelligence_article"}}
